    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">75 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 39 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Snake Game</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The old Nokia snake, built as a 60-minute \"code design\" round: a body that moves in O(1) with a deque plus a hash set, food that never lands on the snake, wall and self collisions (including the tricky tail case), a tick-based game loop with a safe input buffer, and pluggable rules for the follow-ups Atlassian-style interviewers add one by one. Java, Python and C++14 code all run, with tests.</p>\n"
